    "detailed_description": "Game background:<br>The Demon King came here with his men. They destroy your village and plunge the world into darkness. Now you are the village's only hope.<br><br>About the game:<br>--  Construction  --: In the game, you can collect resources and use them to build your walls and towers to defend against enemy attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/402594c6e1503a7b2bdfacd7f155fea3.poster.avif?t=1715611401\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/402594c6e1503a7b2bdfacd7f155fea3.webm?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/402594c6e1503a7b2bdfacd7f155fea3.mp4?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>--  Combat  --: There are enemy patrols every night, be ready to pick up your weapons and face the enemy. Defeat enemies and retrieve the building blueprints stolen by them to unlock more buildings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/d63a86aa7745091edfd311f730ab7e4a.poster.avif?t=1715611401\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/d63a86aa7745091edfd311f730ab7e4a.webm?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/d63a86aa7745091edfd311f730ab7e4a.mp4?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>--  Capture the enemy  --: Yes, in addition to fighting, we can also use ropes to capture them, rescue villagers of different professions, and strengthen the team to resist the darkness. In addition, we can also bribe other creatures to help us fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/72ab424bf3255d1409865050bf219405.poster.avif?t=1715611401\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/72ab424bf3255d1409865050bf219405.webm?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/72ab424bf3255d1409865050bf219405.mp4?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>--  Team fighting  --: You can give orders to other villagers, allowing them to use their strengths and better cooperate with your actions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/02ab1a06c3fca297fbdd5f6c7f388d10.poster.avif?t=1715611401\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/02ab1a06c3fca297fbdd5f6c7f388d10.webm?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/02ab1a06c3fca297fbdd5f6c7f388d10.mp4?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>--  Day and night  --: With the arrival of the devil, each day will become shorter and shorter. It is completely up to you how to arrange your time and what to do.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/e6595773e8f5f1d1e6d1cd409d8785cf.poster.avif?t=1715611401\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/e6595773e8f5f1d1e6d1cd409d8785cf.webm?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899600/extras/e6595773e8f5f1d1e6d1cd409d8785cf.mp4?t=1715611401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Logging, fighting, exploring, building! Nothing is impossible in this action-packed adventure game.<br>Grab your tools and go! Fight your enemies and survive the dark night. Gather resources to create everything you need to create your world.<br>Finally defeat the forces of darkness.<br>But beware, there are many challenges waiting for you... can you complete the mission?<br><br><br><br>-------------Please follow us to get more updated information in time. -- \u0aee\ua4b0 \u02f6\u2022 \u0f1d \u2022\u02f6\ua4b1\u10d0 -----------",
